        <i class="fas fa-truck text-4xl text-rose-400 mb-4" aria-hidden="true"></i>
        <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-800 dark:text-gray-100 mb-2">Entrega a domicilio</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-300">Consulta la zona de cobertura.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="benefit-card fade-in bg-rose-50 dark:bg-gray-800 p-8 rounded-xl text-center hover:-translate-y-1.5 transition-all duration-300 hover:shadow-md dark:hover:shadow-gray-800">
        <i class="fas fa-phone text-4xl text-rose-400 mb-4" aria-hidden="true"></i>
        <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-800 dark:text-gray-100 mb-2">Hacé tu pedido</h3>
